  "contentHtml": "<p>축구공&#160;평면설&#160;-&#160;usb현미경으로&#160;축구공&#160;살피기 <br><br><br>예전에&#160;만들었던&#160;영상인데,&#160;요즘&#160;지구&#160;구체에&#160;대해&#160;수업할&#160;때&#160;인것&#160;같아 <br>올려봅니다. <br><br>&quot;지구&#160;평면설&quot;을&#160;믿는&#160;사람들이&#160;아직도&#160;많다고&#160;하더라구요!! <br><br>교실에&#160;축구공&#160;하나&#160;들고&#160;들어가서&#160;실시간으로&#160;보여주어도&#160;아이들&#160;좋아합니다.!!! <br><br></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7a7bf243c8bb845c603f4e3fbc3580f284b11cd7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7a7bf243c8bb845c603f4e3fbc3580f284b11cd7\" data-orgin-width=\"704\" data-origin-height=\"325\"></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvwe4bae12h61bh3l9fbpfv5s@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/S712x400/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Fthumb.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2Fkamp%2Fsource%2Frvwe4bae12h61bh3l9fbpfv5s%2Fthumbs%2F2.jpg%3Fcredential%3DTuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK%26expires%3D33172869900%26signature%3DyMLm2P8r%252FISIi6dRKVn5QkuGosY%253D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvwe4bae12h61bh3l9fbpfv5s?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2d2U0YmFlMTJoNjFiaDNsOWZicGZ2NXMiLCJ0aWQiOiI2YzgzZmFjYy00MjM1LTQ5YWMtOTM5Yi1kNDYzMmVkZjk3YTYiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODYxMjV9.w-GA7-rlwxZsyCrmLsHxGx8hxflueEJh3NcGGm8SfqR3ruzAkfv-c8RGJ0pXHJ7gHCyBUEzDMQ1tG9eo-qqJng&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"en